OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after father killed
OL,4,Aon pub car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murdering a father of two
OL,8,Ffound stabbed in a pub car park.
OL,10,FAyden Cooper, 25, died at the scene at
OL,11,Fthe Beggars Bush pub, on Chester Road,
OL,12,Fin Sutton Coldfield, just before 02:00
OL,13,FBST on 11 October.
OL,15,FIn a tribute, his family said he was
OL,16,F"full of life and had a heart of gold".
OL,18,FThree men, aged 18 and 21, were
OL,19,Farrested on suspicion of murder and
OL,20,Fremained in custody, police said.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
